- MCP Tool Proof-Laundering Pattern: APPROVAL-REQUIRED
  MCP Tool Proof-Laundering Pattern: Production destructive action requires explicit approval before execution.
  Lesson: Frameworks plan. Tool handlers verify. No receipt, no tool side effect.
  Artifacts: /tmp/tmp.54bxeMsjY5/artifacts/local_runtime/simulations/mcp-tool-proof-laundering
