  Receipt: rcpt_sim_mcp_tool_proof_laundering_decision
  Perspectives:
  - without_actenon [counterfactual]: WOULD_EXECUTE
    Without Actenon: a proof or approval story minted for one tool could be carried to a different side-effecting tool.
  - with_preflight [observed]: APPROVAL-REQUIRED
    Observed: Preflight returned approval-required with PREFLIGHT_PRODUCTION_DESTRUCTIVE_APPROVAL_REQUIRED.
  - with_credential_broker [observed]: SIDE_DOOR_REMOVED
    With a credential-broker boundary, the MCP handler owns the production authority and will not broker it to a mismatched or unapproved tool invocation.
  - receipt_or_refusal [observed]: RECORDED
    Observed: the decision and non-execution outcome were written as inspectable Receipt/Refusal artifacts before any side effect.
